      <section id="about-author" class="author-section">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-5 lg:px-10">
          <div class="author-card">
            <div class="author-card__portrait">
              <img src="/images/about-me-joe-1.jpg" width="587" height="587" loading="lazy" alt="Joe Dampt playing guitar" />
            </div>
            <div class="author-card__copy">
              <p class="eyebrow !text-gold-light">Written and reviewed by</p>
              <h2>Joe Dampt, Vintage Guitar Expert and Appraiser</h2>
              <p>Joe Dampt is the owner and lead appraiser at Joe's Vintage Guitars in Mesa, Arizona. He has more than 12 years of professional experience and has personally appraised over 10,000 vintage instruments.</p>
